{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set in 2083, decades after the Quiet Collapse, <i>The Caretaker\u2019s Lease</i> drops you alone onto <strong>Sagewater Island</strong>, a remote wild reserve managed by the Sage Creek Outfitters. You\u2019re the new caretaker assigned to a slice of this island to monitor wildlife, manage camps, and determine if the land is still viable. The last caretaker vanished without a trace. Armed with only a stocked cabin and a crackling radio, you must survive the winter\u2014and whatever lurks in the silence.<br><i>(This title is currently in Early Access. Features will expand as development continues, and a public roadmap is planned.)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded survival hunting</strong> \u2013 No glowing trails, no waypoints. You track animals by reading real signs: footprints in snow, blood trails, and sound. Future updates will expand tracking to mud, broken branches, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/18076464e484ee9b49de2c6b57d4f4fa.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/18076464e484ee9b49de2c6b57d4f4fa.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=676 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/88d2102e05d98d4c1207608ef6add964.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/88d2102e05d98d4c1207608ef6add964.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=674 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/70e003bec32fec15957fcbaae0d579d7.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/9223fbbfd96852585697b6063ea8e170.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/9223fbbfd96852585697b6063ea8e170.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=674 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapping &amp; realistic blood tracking</strong> \u2013 Set traps to catch smaller game and follow blood trails to find wounded animals. Shot placement matters: every hit determines organ damage, bleed rate, and blood color.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic meat weight &amp; skinning</strong> \u2013 Every kill counts. Skin, process, and pack what you can carry. Carry weight matters and will affect your movement and stamina in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/5490e4b346660255d78c8373fa41b979.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/5490e4b346660255d78c8373fa41b979.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=674 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic antlers &amp; animal behavior</strong> \u2013 Antlers grow based on age, genetics, and nutrition. No two animals are the same, and predator/prey behavior changes with weather and time of year.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/3ba7aa609ca1974a1bae0a43bbcb49b1.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag system with consequences</strong> \u2013 Large game requires a limited set of tags issued by your outfitters. Taking the wrong animal ends your contract. Trappable animals and rogue threats may be exempt, but mistakes have consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/2ea6e785d590058b8576de426641db93.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1202 height=942 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic threats</strong> \u2013 Survival isn\u2019t just about the weather and wildlife. As development continues, new challenges will be added to keep the world unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary animals (\u201cGhosts\u201d)</strong> \u2013 Each region hides a near\u2011mythical animal. Sometimes it\u2019s a predator; sometimes it\u2019s prey. If you see it, you might get only one shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeb\u2019s journal &amp; story mysteries</strong> \u2013 Discover scattered pages from the previous caretaker. Learn survival tricks and uncover a slow\u2011burn horror narrative that explores why the last caretaker disappeared and what the Quiet Collapse left behind.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Caretaker\u2019s Lease</i> blends realistic hunting simulation with a chilling sense of isolation. There\u2019s no plague, no bombs just too much optimization and trust. The world is quieter, colder, and far more wild. You\u2019re here to do a job, but the longer you stay, the more the land reveals about itself\u2026 and about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And it doesn\u2019t just whisper back\u00a0 \u00a0it remembers.</strong> <br>Notes left behind by the last caretaker suggest something deeper than tracks and tags.<br><i>\u201cBlood runs warm beneath the frost\u2026\u201d</i><br><i>Some say it\u2019s just a myth. Others say that\u2019s why no one returns after winter.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locals whisper about old myths\u00a0 \u00a0things that walk when the snow falls, creatures the Quiet Collapse never erased.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some say they\u2019re just stories to scare new caretakers. Others swear the woods remember every scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/0556eb2c8407b1bf1411f357d6eca88b.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/0556eb2c8407b1bf1411f357d6eca88b.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=676 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/13060d59bc182a102e8b58e5b5ab0679.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1309 height=1802 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906970?t=1761158294","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/809f9304557bac6ddb8c6c785bb944c30eb12873/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761158294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/ea40f66ff7afead48bcbd1423b3fb1e626fcc47d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761158294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/ea40f66ff7afead48bcbd1423b3fb1e626fcc47d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761158294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set in 2083, decades after the Quiet Collapse, <i>The Caretaker\u2019s Lease</i> drops you alone onto <strong>Sagewater Island</strong>, a remote wild reserve managed by the Sage Creek Outfitters. You\u2019re the new caretaker assigned to a slice of this island to monitor wildlife, manage camps, and determine if the land is still viable. The last caretaker vanished without a trace. Armed with only a stocked cabin and a crackling radio, you must survive the winter\u2014and whatever lurks in the silence.<br><i>(This title is currently in Early Access. Features will expand as development continues, and a public roadmap is planned.)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded survival hunting</strong> \u2013 No glowing trails, no waypoints. You track animals by reading real signs: footprints in snow, blood trails, and sound. Future updates will expand tracking to mud, broken branches, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/18076464e484ee9b49de2c6b57d4f4fa.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/18076464e484ee9b49de2c6b57d4f4fa.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=676 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/88d2102e05d98d4c1207608ef6add964.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/88d2102e05d98d4c1207608ef6add964.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=674 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/70e003bec32fec15957fcbaae0d579d7.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1600 height=900 /><