our outfitters. Taking the wrong animal ends your contract. Trappable animals and rogue threats may be exempt, but mistakes have consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/2ea6e785d590058b8576de426641db93.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1202 height=942 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic threats</strong> \u2013 Survival isn\u2019t just about the weather and wildlife. As development continues, new challenges will be added to keep the world unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary animals (\u201cGhosts\u201d)</strong> \u2013 Each region hides a near\u2011mythical animal. Sometimes it\u2019s a predator; sometimes it\u2019s prey. If you see it, you might get only one shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeb\u2019s journal &amp; story mysteries</strong> \u2013 Discover scattered pages from the previous caretaker. Learn survival tricks and uncover a slow\u2011burn horror narrative that explores why the last caretaker disappeared and what the Quiet Collapse left behind.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Caretaker\u2019s Lease</i> blends realistic hunting simulation with a chilling sense of isolation. There\u2019s no plague, no bombs just too much optimization and trust. The world is quieter, colder, and far more wild. You\u2019re here to do a job, but the longer you stay, the more the land reveals about itself\u2026 and about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And it doesn\u2019t just whisper back\u00a0 \u00a0it remembers.</strong> <br>Notes left behind by the last caretaker suggest something deeper than tracks and tags.<br><i>\u201cBlood runs warm beneath the frost\u2026\u201d</i><br><i>Some say it\u2019s just a myth. Others say that\u2019s why no one returns after winter.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locals whisper about old myths\u00a0 \u00a0things that walk when the snow falls, creatures the Quiet Collapse never erased.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some say they\u2019re just stories to scare new caretakers. Others swear the woods remember every scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/0556eb2c8407b1bf1411f357d6eca88b.avif?t=1761158294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/0556eb2c8407b1bf1411f357d6eca88b.avif?t=1761158294 width=1600 height=676 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/13060d59bc182a102e8b58e5b5ab0679.avif?t=1761158294\" width=1309 height=1802 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Invisible Ghost Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/f69252c6837f359f81ad64f9c027b25929069613/header.jpg?t=1761158294","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906970/683673835/a136747296d64e43cf9b77f03c24675d9f1ee1a1/1757721712/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760474911","dash_h264":"https